                            <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وَدَكٌ</span></b> 
                        
                        <i>Grease,</i> or <i>gravy:</i> i. e. the <i>oily matter
that is produced from flesh-meat;</i> (TA;) or the
<i>dripping that exudes from flesh-meat</i> and <i>from
fat.</i> (Mgh, Msb.)

